==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Unbroken Bonds|Melmetal|129}} from the {{TCG|Unbroken Bonds}} expansion.
**Both cards have the '''Heavy Impact''' attack, which first appeared on {{TCG ID|EX Team Rocket Returns|Dark Steelix|10}} from the {{TCG|EX Team Rocket Returns}} expansion.
*'''Hard Coat''' is an {{TCG|Ability}} that first appeared on {{TCG ID|SM Promo|Melmetal-GX|178}}, one of the {{TCG|SM Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

